    //
    // Due to the loop-carried dependencies (IIR recurrences) along rows
    // and columns, we keep the recursive passes as explicit C++ loops
    // over Halide::Buffer data. These recurrences cannot be expressed
    // as legal Halide update definitions (they require references like
